              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "अवतिष्ठते (avatiṣṭhate) is built from ava, \"down\", and the root √sthā, \"to stand\", which also gives tiṣṭhati, \"stands\"; MW gives ava-sthā as to remain or stay, with the participle avasthita, and Pāṇini (1.3.22) gives √sthā the middle endings after ava (MW)."
